; Disposable WB 3.1 Which resident option/order probe. Output is retained in S:Shell-Startup.
FailAt 20
Path C:
Echo "BEGIN" >S:Shell-Startup
Resident >NIL: C:Execute PURE
Echo "DEFAULT" >>S:Shell-Startup
C:Which Execute >>S:Shell-Startup
Echo "RES" >>S:Shell-Startup
C:Which Execute RES >>S:Shell-Startup
Echo "NORES" >>S:Shell-Startup
C:Which Execute NORES >>S:Shell-Startup
Echo "ALL" >>S:Shell-Startup
C:Which Execute ALL >>S:Shell-Startup
Resident >NIL: Execute REMOVE
Echo "END" >>S:Shell-Startup
EndCLI >NIL:
